; =============================================================================
;  RIG
;  Joint heights above the sole, in units:
;    ankle 0.10  knee 0.73  hip 1.35  spine 1.54  chest 1.80
;    shoulder 2.06  elbow 1.61  wrist 1.24  neck 2.10  head 2.26  crown 2.58
;  Elbow and wrist are quoted before the bind-pose arm splay, which lifts them
;  about a centimetre. These are the standard human fractions of total height,
;  so anything animated against them reads as a person rather than a doll.
; =============================================================================

